cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "dissmodel-abm: TerraME-style agent-based modeling for DisSModel"
abstract: >-
  Agent-based modeling extension for the DisSModel framework, following
  TerraME's concepts (Agent, Society, CellularSpace, placement, social
  networks and messages) on a raster cellular space, with one seeded random
  generator per model. Includes models ported from TerraME's logo package.
authors:
